          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "TRING                 WICK ROAD SP 90 NW                                         (South side)                                         Wigginton 6/115                                   Barn next house -                                       at Wick Farm GV                                      II Barn.  Early  C17.  Timber  frame  on  tarred  brick  base,  tarred weatherboarding and steep pitched roof now slated. A tall 6-bays double barn facing W with double doors in 2nd bay from each end. Jowled posts, mid-height rail and straight tension braces. Clasped-purlin roof with one purlin in each slope and straight wind-braces. Old flat rafters and collar and tie-beam trusses. Listing NGR: SP9311109711"
    }
